// added by tests/scenarios/run.py to td.scn, whose own trainsets were removed.
// a line of its own, away from the tracks of td.scn: 600 m level, then 2500 m up a gradient of 10 per mille,
// under an overhead wire. the train starts on the level with its head 10 m before the W4 of Gora and runs on the
// timetable {{timetable}} (no stop; a freight train leaves Gora at once) up to the signal hu_sem1 1000 m up the gradient, at stop until 10:42,
// where it stops with the whole train on the gradient, then on to the signal hu_sem2 at stop 2300 m up the
// gradient. the line goes on 200 m past it
